Single-tenant-per-deploy or shared-schema multi-tenant? This forks the whole
data layer (every table's key shape, every query's scoping, backup/isolation
story), so it must lock before any schema-shaped decision. Candidate answers
diverge hard: one deploy per customer team vs one shared schema with a
team/org discriminator column.

